lia—returns with burdens she can’t conceal, Zach knows he can no longer hide and wait. Stealth and shadow are familiar aides as he begins a secret investigation into the troubles that haunt her. \n\nBut while Father Zach may be content to fade back into the shadows, Emilia has other plans for the humble priest. She won’t stop until she drags him into the light—and reveals just how respected he should be!\n\n---\n\n[Official English light novel release.](https://j-novel.club/series/father-have-you-sinned-an-assassin-in-priest-s-robes)","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/5b84be89-b281-4842-823d-ce830e23101f/b2e4dd35-a43a-4f79-9ce7-989df7a4a53e.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["id","en"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.23,"follows":1150,"listAt":"2026-10-21T01:04:50.659Z","chapters":[{"id":"eb9c5aba-4fa3-4e09-8f08-d256a2b1a5ce","number":"0","volume":"1","title":"The Strongest Assassin Retired to open an Orphanage","lang":"en","pages":16,"createdAt":"2026-10-14T23:31:25+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"74b9db55-4711-40b1-9a9f-bde6b06dcf58","number":"0","volume":"1","title":"Pembunuh bayaran terkuat yang pensiun ","lang":"id","pages":16,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T08:56:52+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":2,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:30:48.209Z"},"3136a23b-b8c0-48f4-9d89-fbeb63927c4a":{"id":"3136a23b-b8c0-48f4-9d89-fbeb63927c4a","title":"Gwijjal Romance","altTitle":"Ghost Romance","description":"Seonwoo Yoo, a senior in the photography department, is working as a photographer. One day, he receives a collaboration proposal from a famous overseas magazine.For a while, such a fluttering heartRecently, a jokjok ghost taking a picture is taken together'Seon-woo', who suffered from a psychic phenomenon, tries in various ways to solve it, but it is not easy.In the meantime, the psychic picture was not taken.They find the only subject... I